    "body": "The `decodepsbt` incorrectly truncates the (32 bit) sighash type field before looking up its human friendly name. It's not dangerous, as such a signature would be invalid, but potentially confusing.\r\n\r\nFix that and add a test.\r\n\r\nI plan to use `SighashToStr` in another pull request to render an error message for invalid sighash type field values, but it seemed worth fixing in a standalone PR.",
